 robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "301.wake::nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "301.wake::proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 6, "summary": "Autonomous agents leverage curiosity-driven learning to navigate complex environments, effectively bootstrapping discovery in the presence of deceptive or sparse rewards. PC-PPO and related multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) frameworks allow for non-dominated policy maintenance, yet systems remain limited b…", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "78d3bd258b289f5fe7c74ecebd59db0f8313e655a15712fd09bd7ab1f032e783", "hash": "121bd1667310e38e0389b961d5ec0c9bfef46908cc6416aed918791f3d51a87f", "origin": {"node": "301.wake", "head": "b6f88039e7626701a37dcbb826d2bd94ce5275c535f280af17f07ab3d04a919f", "version": 68}, "original_event": {"seq": 3590, "time": "2026-10-27T02:14:34.641908+00:00", "kind": "invocation_started", "payload": {"attention": {"active": true, "attention": {"accepted_streak": 3, "topic": "continuity_rationale"}, "attention_saturation_threshold": 5, "capability_blocked_topics": [], "cooldown_other_attempts": 3, "current_topic_unconfigured": false, "deferred_topics": [], "enforce_selected_topic": false, "hard_rejection_threshold": 5, "parked": {}, "reason": "current durable project topic remains eligible", "rotation_required": false, "saturation_release_condition": "accepted notebook on another topic", "selected_topic": "unassigned_problem", "temporal": {"anchor_seq": 3588, "ancho